            "value" : "Hai visto due soli sorgere insieme."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ふたつの太陽が並んでのぼるのを見届けました。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "두 개의 해가 함께 떠오르는 걸 지켜봤어요."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Você viu dois sóis nascerem juntos."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "На твоих глазах вместе взошли два солнца."
          }
        },
        "th" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "คุณได้เห็นตะวันสองดวงขึ้นพร้อมกัน"
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "İki güneşin birlikte doğuşunu izledin."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你目睹了两轮太阳一同升起。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You'll be charged %@ on %@ unless you cancel before." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "سيتم خصم %1$@ في %2$@ ما لم تُلغِ قبل ذلك."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Am %2$@ werden dir %1$@ berechnet, wenn du nicht vorher kündigst."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "You'll be charged %1$@ on %2$@ unless you cancel before."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Se te cobrarán %1$@ el %2$@, salvo que canceles antes."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%1$@ te seront facturés le %2$@, sauf si tu résilies avant."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ti verranno addebitati %1$@ il %2$@, a meno che tu non annulli prima."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "それまでに解約しない場合、%2$@に%1$@が請求されます。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "그 전에 취소하지 않으면 %2$@에 %1$@이(가) 결제돼요."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Você será cobrado %1$@ em %2$@, a menos que cancele antes."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%2$@ будет списано %1$@, если вы не отмените подписку раньше."
          }
        },
        "th" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "หากไม่ยกเลิกก่อน ระบบจะเรียกเก็บเงิน %1$@ ในวันที่ %2$@"
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Öncesinde iptal etmezsen %2$@ tarihinde %1$@ ücretlendirilirsin."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如未提前取消，将于 %2$@ 扣费 %1$@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You'll keep a smaller star for the %lld minutes you focused. Nothing is lost." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ستحتفظ بنجمة أصغر مقابل %lld دقيقة ركّزت فيها. لم يضِع شيء."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Für die %lld Minuten, die du fokussiert warst, bekommst du einen kleineren Stern. Nichts geht verloren."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Conservarás una estrella más pequeña por los %lld minutos que te concentraste. No se pierde nada."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tu garderas une étoile plus petite pour les %lld minutes de concentration. Rien n’est perdu."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Terrai una stella più piccola per i %lld minuti di concentrazione. Non si perde nulla."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "集中した%lld分のぶん、小さめの星が残ります。何も失われません。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "집중한 %lld분만큼 조금 작은 별이 남아요. 잃는 건 없어요."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Você fica com uma estrela menor pelos %lld minutos em que focou. Nada se perde."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ты сохранишь звезду поменьше за %lld минут фокуса. Ничего не потеряно."
          }
        },
        "th" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "คุณจะได้ดาวดวงเล็กลงสำหรับ %lld นาทีที่โฟกัสไป ไม่มีอะไรสูญหาย"
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Odaklandığın %lld dakika için daha küçük bir yıldız kalacak. Hiçbir şey kaybolmaz."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你专注的 %lld 分钟会化作一颗较小的星星留下，什么都不会失去。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You're building something beautiful." : {
